WEBVTT

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:41.040
Don't worry, Monica.

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:44.610
I'm okay.
But my brother's match...

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:47.380
That's right.
It's going to start soon.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:50.790
But I'm sure
Moses will win!

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:55.360
If you could ask the doctor to
delay the surgery a little...

00:01:55.360 --> 00:02:00.330
I know you want to cheer him on,
but Moses's job is to fight with his Beyblade.

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:03.800
And your job is to
get better, Monica.

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:07.610
You need to work
hard at your job.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:11.900
I'm sure your
feelings will reach him!

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:15.500
Yeah...

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:19.330
You can do it, big brother!

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:37.560
Ming-Ming has won the first match of
the Justice 5 after a hard-fought battle!

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:40.440
BEGA has
taken the first win!

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:46.180
I knew I should
have gotten out there!

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:51.370
I'm the only one
who can beat her!!

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:54.980
Calm down.
What's done is done.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:58.490
The two of them fought
an amazing battle.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.380
We're just getting started.

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:05.800
Go out there and show 'em
what we're made of, Rei!

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:14.220
The next battle
will be Moses VS Rei!

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:20.410
Listen to this storm
of cheers for Moses!

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:46.610
He's another Blader whose
popularity has been on the rise!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:51.100
To heal his hospitalized
little sister Monica...

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:56.730
This is the path he chose!
The path to become a pro Blader!

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:01.580
But it was a path
full of hurdles!

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:05.580
Starting as
a complete novice!

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:08.970
Difficult training in
a path of uncertainty!

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:12.160
Intense battles against
the strongest of rivals!

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:14.900
And yet he withstood it all!

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:18.650
He kept fighting!

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:22.800
He has worked so hard to see
his sister's healthy smile again.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:27.800
And how he's come so far as to
become one of BEGA's elite Bladers!

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:31.410
Today is the day
of Monica's operation.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:36.560
For Moses, this match is special.
He vows to win and go visit her.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:39.240
Those were the words
he spoke with passion!

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:46.450
Good luck, Moses! Your sister and all of us
in the audience will be watching over you!

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:53.240
Oh, shut up.
They're all gaga for Moses.

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:55.540
This is a real downer...

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:59.770
No way! Rei doesn't care
about any of that junk!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.570
Isn't that right, Rai?

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.070
Rai?

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:10.650
Rei isn't such a weak Blader that
he'd let the crowd distract him.

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:17.700
But even if he logically tries overcome that, his heart might have different ideas.

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:20.370
Rei's just that nice.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:21.770
Rei...

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:29.170
It's time for the second
match of the Justice 5!

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:33.680
My heart's about to
burst in anticipation!

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.260
Kick that guy's butt!

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.530
Relax, relax!

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:52.100
Show 'em at your best!

00:05:52.340 --> 00:05:55.740
Yes. Thank you, all of you.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:04.040
Let's do it!
Let's do it! Let's do it!

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:09.900
He's so into it!

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:12.160
Maybe a little
too into it.

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:17.770
No, this is perfect.
Moses fights with his emotions, after all.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.500
Monica...

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:23.970
Your brother won't lose. Not even if I'm
up against the best in the world.

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:27.650
Or even if I'm up against
the best in the universe!

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:31.930
Do your best, big brother!

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:36.180
I'll do my best.
I will, Monica!

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:39.170
Your brother will
keep his promise!

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:55.090
The second match of the Justice 5 will
be held in the Battlefield Stadium!

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:59.620
The various obstacles will
make it difficult to see!

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:02.700
Will BEGA take another
step towards victory?

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:06.930
Or will the G-Revolutions
even the score?

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:24.680
Three! Two! One!

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:27.840
Go, Shoot!

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:31.340
Go!!

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:40.060
Look out, Rei!

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:41.330
Rei!

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:52.770
He suddenly went
crashing into the building!

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:53.770
Wasn't that...

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:59.940
Yes. That wasn't a fluke. Rei used his dodge as a chance to counter.

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:04.210
That's how Moses lost his balance and crashed into that building.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:08.560
To be able to counter Moses
in the blink of an eye...

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:11.980
That isn't something any
average Blader can pull off.

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:14.080
Rei's good.

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:20.840
Moses, I understand that
you don't want to lose.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:27.250
Moses is back on his feet!
He's still raring to go!

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.730
Here I come!

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:31.800
But I cannot accept defeat!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:40.450
As a member of the G-Revolutions
and the White Tiger Clan...

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:44.900
And as a Blader!
I cannot lose!

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:53.320
Keep going, Gigars!

00:08:57.690 --> 00:09:03.650
I cannot allow Volkov to lay a finger
on the Beybattles we've loved...

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:08.370
So I will put everything
on the line to beat you!

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:14.460
Go for it, Rei!

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:18.530
Rei's a demon...
A demon with a desire to win!

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:21.530
That's it, Rei!
Go get 'im!

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:23.770
That counter was amazing!

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:29.010
It sends his opponent's own
power right back at them!

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:34.850
It's the best strategy to make use of
all of Driger Metal Slash's speed!

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:38.740
It's incredible! Rei doesn't
have a single blind spot!

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:41.740
You're amazing, Rei!
You really are!

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:54.060
Rei dishes out
a deadly assault!

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:57.200
Gigars is getting thrown
around like a sandbag!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.060
Darn it!

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:04.530
This one-sided assault has left
Moses's fans in total silence!

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:19.930
A sudden accident!
Is Moses okay?

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:24.760
Doctor, her heart
rate is dropping!

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:26.410
Monica!

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:41.220
I can't do it...
I can't see his moves!

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.120
I can't keep up!

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.600
He's strong...
Too strong for me!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:59.140
Driger attacks,
attacks, and attacks!

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:02.140
Is this the end?!

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:15.770
Darn...

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:19.170
Driger's fangs have
caught the beast!

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:21.400
Moses is in big trouble!

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:24.220
Is he going to get crushed
by the tiger's fangs?!

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:26.540
This is the end for you!

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:31.900
Monica, hang in there!

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:35.560
Your brother's still fighting,
so you can too!

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:39.410
Big brother...
Big brother...!

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:44.130
Monica...

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:55.840
Monica!!!

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:05.910
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:27.730
Moses has made a miraculous
escape from the jaws of defeat!

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:33.320
He has incredible power... Breaking out of that shouldn't have been easy...

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:41.540
I won't cry.

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.560
I will not cry!

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:46.010
I made my choice!

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:50.440
Monica's in more pain
than I could ever be in!

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:54.940
She's suffering so much more! And yet she's still fighting...

00:12:54.940 --> 00:13:00.320
So I will never cry from
an attack like that!

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:01.850
Gigars!

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:09.700
Is this an earthquake?!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:13.690
No, it's not!
Gigars is shaking the stadium!

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:16.280
You can feel the
shockwaves from here!

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:18.860
But how...?

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:25.040
Take this!!

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.930
How's that?

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:44.640
Incredible! Driger has been caught in
the pillars created by the earthquake!

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:47.530
Blast! This won't...

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:54.300
His Bey is like the ground. He can change
the very foundations of the stadium itself.

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:57.960
Even Rei won't be
able to escape it.

00:13:57.960 --> 00:14:00.980
Watch me, Monica...

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:06.170
I cannot lose here!

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:07.500
Rei, you have to win!

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:08.540
Rei!!

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.290
Guts! Ya need guts!

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:12.080
Never give up!

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.860
Rei! Show him what
you're made of!

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:18.700
Take this!!

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:02.240
Rei escapes from
the clutches of Gigars!

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:07.540
The white tiger has snapped
off one of Gigars's claws!

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:11.880
Like I said, I cannot allow
myself to lose either!

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:16.730
Bladers from all over the world came together for this match...

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:21.890
We came together to create our
Heavy Metal Beys from scratch...

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:26.720
The White Tiger Clan that's
always there for me.

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:31.560
My teammates who taught me
unforgettable lessons through battle!

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:40.740
And my greatest rival, who responded
to how I felt with everything he had!

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:46.880
I'm here now because I've got all their hopes riding on me!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:52.200
And I'll use the full extent of my strength
to make sure I don't let them down!

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:54.620
So will I!

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:57.690
Monica gives me strength...

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:01.050
Monica smiles for me...

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:06.170
As long as she's there for me,
I'll get back up again and again!

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.980
I fight again and again!

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:15.740
Watch me fight, Monica.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:19.560
Can you hear me
shout, Monica?

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:23.960
I will win! I will win for
your smile, Monica!

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:33.370
Both of them are about to
unleash their special moves!

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:43.180
Her heart rate is stabilizing!
She's regaining strength!

00:16:44.180 --> 00:16:45.920
Oh, Monica!

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:11.050
What an incredible power battle!

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:15.730
It's a big bang battle, on the level
of the creation of the universe itself!

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:44.050
I will not accept defeat!
For my friends!

00:17:44.050 --> 00:17:46.490
For the future of Beyblade!

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:51.340
Watch me battle, Monica!
I will not lose!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.620
I refuse...

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:55.530
--I refuse to lose!!
--I refuse to lose!!

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:13.660
Thunder Slash!!

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:20.820
Demolition Axe!!

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:01.700
This battle's not over!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.650
Who's gonna win?!

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:05.780
--Rei!!

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:07.490
Big brother...

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:20.520
Big brother!

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:29.260
Moses miraculously
makes it back in!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.120
Rei, Stadium Out!

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:35.980
Moses wins!!

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:46.960
Brother...!

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:51.320
BEGA makes its second win!

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:54.740
The G-Revolutions have their
backs against the wall!

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:58.330
No way!
You gotta be kidding me!

00:19:58.330 --> 00:19:59.930
No...!

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:03.090
Darn it! Darn it!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:07.050
Rei...

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:15.970
No... I didn't win...

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:23.160
I couldn't stop you. Gigars landed
in the stadium by coincidence...

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:30.000
That was no coincidence.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.690
But...

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:35.410
Your love for your
sister decided the result.

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:38.940
That was the factor
that ended the battle!

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:42.810
My love for Monica...

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:50.520
You win, Moses!

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:59.000
Monica!!
I won! I won!!

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:04.090
I promise to
battle you again!

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:07.920
Yes. Let's battle
again sometime.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:14.200
Rei and Moses praise
each other's efforts.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:17.120
What a wonderful sight!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:22.660
It really sucks that we lost...

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:27.720
But you're the best, Rei!

00:22:55.880 --> 00:23:02.360
Now and Rei and Daichi have lost, we can't lose again!

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:07.220
Max's defensive style
is no match for Mystel!

00:23:07.220 --> 00:23:10.060
It might be a better idea to
change his strategy this time.

00:23:10.060 --> 00:23:12.880
Shock! You guys
don't trust me!

00:23:12.880 --> 00:23:13.970
Max?!

00:23:13.970 --> 00:23:16.170
What do you guys
know about me?

00:23:16.170 --> 00:23:21.400
OK! Let me show you! This is my
battle style, and I'm going to win!
